;
SHEET
DETERMINATION METHOD: DSSP
SHEETS PRESENTED AS "AB", "BA","CB" IN EACH CHAIN
ON SHEET RECORDS BELOW ARE ACTUALLY  8-STRANDED BARRELS
THIS IS REPRESENTED BY  9-STRANDED SHEETS
IN WHICH THE FIRST AND LAST STRANDS ARE IDENTICAL.

SHEET
DETERMINATION METHOD: DSSP
THE SHEETS PRESENTED AS "DA", "EB","FA","GB", "HA"
IN EACH CHAIN ON SHEET RECORDS BELOW ARE
ACTUALLY 7-STRANDED BARRELS THIS IS REPRESENTED BY
A  8-STRANDED SHEET IN WHICH THE FIRST AND LAST STRANDS
ARE IDENTICAL.
